
@统一卖春积极性
	N:9 = 0
	PRINTFORML 统一设置迷宫内角色的"卖春积极性"
	PRINTBUTTON "[ 全侵攻中的勇者 ]  ", 2000
	PRINTBUTTON "  [ 全迎击中的奴隶 ]  ", 2001
	PRINTBUTTON "  [ 所有侵攻与迎击者 ]  ", 2002
	PRINTBUTTON "  [ 取消設置 ]  ", 2003
	PRINTFORML
	INPUT
	IF RESULT == 2000
		PRINTFORML 要将积极性设置为多少？
		PRINTBUTTON "[ 0 ]  ", 0
		PRINTBUTTON "  [ 1 ]  ", 1
		PRINTBUTTON "  [ 2 ]  ", 2
		PRINTBUTTON "  [ 3 ]  ", 3
		PRINTBUTTON "  [ 4 ]  ", 4
		PRINTBUTTON "  [ 5 ]  ", 5
		PRINTFORML
		INPUT
		IF  RESULT < 6 
			N:9 = RESULT
			REPEAT CHARANUM
				SIF COUNT == MASTER
					CONTINUE
				IF CFLAG:COUNT:1 == 2
					CFLAG:COUNT:120 = N:9
				ENDIF	
			REND
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORMW 已将当前迷宫侵攻中的勇者（不含以後出现的新勇者），卖春积极性全设置为{N:9}了
	ELSEIF RESULT == 2001
		PRINTFORML 要将积极性设置为多少？
		PRINTBUTTON "[ 0 ]  ", 0
		PRINTBUTTON "  [ 1 ]  ", 1
		PRINTBUTTON "  [ 2 ]  ", 2
		PRINTBUTTON "  [ 3 ]  ", 3
		PRINTBUTTON "  [ 4 ]  ", 4
		PRINTBUTTON "  [ 5 ]  ", 5
		PRINTFORML
		INPUT
		IF  RESULT < 6 
			N:9 = RESULT
			REPEAT CHARANUM
				SIF COUNT == MASTER
					CONTINUE
				IF CFLAG:COUNT:1 == 3
					CFLAG:COUNT:120 = N:9
				ENDIF	
			REND
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORMW 已将当前迷宫全迎击中的奴隶（不含以後追加的新奴隶），卖春积极性全设置为{N:9}了
	ELSEIF RESULT == 2002
		PRINTFORML 要将积极性设置为多少？
		PRINTBUTTON "[ 0 ]  ", 0
		PRINTBUTTON "  [ 1 ]  ", 1
		PRINTBUTTON "  [ 2 ]  ", 2
		PRINTBUTTON "  [ 3 ]  ", 3
		PRINTBUTTON "  [ 4 ]  ", 4
		PRINTBUTTON "  [ 5 ]  ", 5
		PRINTFORML
		INPUT
		IF  RESULT < 6 
			N:9 = RESULT
			REPEAT CHARANUM
				SIF COUNT == MASTER
					CONTINUE
				IF CFLAG:COUNT:1 == 2 || CFLAG:COUNT:1 == 3
					CFLAG:COUNT:120 = N:9
				ENDIF	
			REND
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORMW 已将当前迷宫所有侵攻与迎击者（不含以後新入迷宫的对象），卖春积极性全设置为{N:9}了
	ELSE
	ENDIF
	JUMP CHARA_INFO
